From: Tutor Trellis <noreply@tutortrellis.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:20:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(mobile/system-pip): show the participant on stage in
 iOS's picture in picture

Behind the ios.system-pip.enabled feature flag (off by default). While in a
conference the native window is enabled and told whom to show: the participant
on stage unless that's us (a remote screen share comes on stage by itself),
else the dominant speaker, else the latest remote participant with video;
never ourselves, a bot, a whiteboard or a shared video. Muted video, or video
the bridge isn't sending, shows the participant's avatar initials and name.

While the window shows, last N stays at 1 in the background instead of 0, so
the participant on stage keeps coming.
